Package: omopHeor
Title: Health Economics and Outcomes Research Pipeline on OMOP CDM
Version: 0.7.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Gabriel",
           family = "Maeztu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gabriel@iomed.health")
  )
Description: An R metapackage providing an end-to-end analytical ecosystem for
    Real-World Evidence (RWE) and Health Economics and Outcomes Research (HEOR).
    Unifies 'CohortUtilisation' (Healthcare Resource Utilization), 'CohortCosts'
    (direct medical expenditures), and 'CohortEconomics' (propensity scores,
    Markov simulation, and Cost-Effectiveness Analysis) on Observational Medical
    Outcomes Partnership (OMOP) Common Data Model (CDM) data.
